== Grab Bag ==
{{infobox entity
 | dlc     = a
 | name    = Grab Bag
 | id      = 5
 | variant = 69
 | subtype = 1
}}

The '''Grab Bag''' will spawn 1-4 random pickups upon touching it. 
* 35% {{e|Key}}
* 27% {{e|Penny}} 
* 26% {{e|Bomb}} 
* 7% [[card]]/[[rune]]
* 6% [[battery]]
They will not drop any [[heart]]s, [[pill]]s, or [[chest]]s, and they have an increased chance to drop {{E|Lil' Battery|text=Lil' Batteries}}. {{i|Sack Head}} has a 33% chance to replace pickups with sacks. {{dlc|r}} Shops have a chance to sell sacks for seven coins.

Random sacks have a 99% chance to be a grab bag. Has a 1% of replacing a chest.
{{clear}}

== Black Sack ==
{{infobox entity
 | dlc         = r
 | name        = Black Sack
 | subtype     = 2
 | unlocked by = Black Sack
}}

A '''Black Sack''' will spawn 2-3 
* 35% [[Pill]]s
* 20% {{e|Black Heart}} 
* 10% {{e|Bone Heart}} 
* 35% {{e|Bomb}}s 
when collected. Only one heart can spawn from one sack, but there may be two pills or bombs.

Random sacks have a 1% chance to be a black sack.

Sacks will replace Black Sacks until unlocked.
{{dlc clear}}

== Notes ==
* {{dlc|r}} Bone hearts can spawn from Black Sacks even if they haven't been unlocked yet.
* The probabilities above refer to the kind of sack that is generated by the game when a sack is spawned with a sub-type of 0 (i.e. a random sack).

